<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>XYZ Company</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        button:hover{
            background-color: hsla(17, 100%, 50%, 0.979);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="m-0 p-0 bg-slate-200">
    <div class="mx-[25%] bg-white p-[3%] ">
        <h1 class="text-[40px] font-bold mx-[20px] my-[10px] text-center">TURBO XTREME ⚡</h1>
        <p class="text-justify mb-[10px]">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sed odit quis reprehenderit
            consequatur fuga! Laudantium explicabo nihil soluta magnam rem animi ab, iste et sed iusto doloribus?
            Ratione cumque molestiae, aut itaque, eveniet vero asperiores magni excepturi culpa in dolorem repellat sed.
            Inventore nesciunt, dignissimos minima dicta mollitia non numquam!</p>
        <b class="text-[20px] ">Application Form 💡</b>
        <p class="mb-[10px]"></p>
        <form action="/apply" method="POST">
            <B>Name :</B> <input placeholder="Enter Name" type="text" name="name" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <B>Email :</B> <input placeholder="Enter Email" type="email" name="email" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <B>Phone No (+91):</B> <input type="tel" placeholder="Enter Contact Number" name="phone" maxlength="10" pattern="[0-9]{10}" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <B>DOB :</B> <input type="date" name="dob" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <B>Address :</B> <input placeholder="Enter Address" type="text" name="address" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <B>Position :</B>
            <select name="position" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
                <option value="Select one" selected disabled>Select one</option>
                <option value="Full Stack Developer">Full Stack Developer</option>
                <option value="Data Scientist">Data Scientist</option>
                <option value="Android Developer">Android Developer</option>
                <option value="Consultant">Consultant</option>
            </select>
            <p></p>
            <B>Experience :</B>
            <select name="experience" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
                <option value="Select one" selected disabled>Select one</option>
                <option value="Fresher">Fresher</option>
                <option value="1-3">1-3 Years</option>
                <option value="4+">4+ Years</option>
            </select>
            <p></p>
            <B>Resume Link :</B> <input placeholder="Enter Resume link " type="text" name="resume" id="" class="bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-sm w-full" required>
            <p class="my-[30px]"></p>
            <button type="submit" class=" text-[18px] text-white font-bold bg-orange-400 p-[8px] border-[2px] w-[150px] border-black cursor-pointer">Submit</button>

        </form>
    </div>

</body>

</html>